{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "owner": "boburning",
  "repository": "boburning/portcove",
  "active_release": "Public beta",
  "project": {
    "number": 1,
    "title": "Portcove Roadmap",
    "visibility": "PUBLIC",
    "description": "Product outcomes, release readiness, execution and the complete port pipeline in one live Project.",
    "readme": "Start with [Product Outcomes](https://github.com/users/boburning/projects/1/views/5) for direction and delivered foundations.\n\n[Required for Beta](https://github.com/users/boburning/projects/1/views/6) and [Required through 1.0](https://github.com/users/boburning/projects/1/views/10) show direct obligations; use roadmap.mjs readiness for the complete dependency-derived gate. [Planned Additions](https://github.com/users/boburning/projects/1/views/9) remain approved executable work.\n\n[In Progress](https://github.com/users/boburning/projects/1/views/3) plus [accepted reservations #793](https://github.com/boburning/portcove/issues/793) describe execution; [Next Queue](https://github.com/users/boburning/projects/1/views/2) shows selection, and [Port Pipeline](https://github.com/users/boburning/projects/1/views/4) retains every durable port record.\n\nIssues own current acceptance/evidence, catalog.json owns support, and [roadmap orientation](https://github.com/boburning/portcove/blob/main/docs/ROADMAP.md) explains the release contract. roadmap-outcome is presentation only. Required and Planned share execution. Genuine owner decisions appear with effect/recommendation in the existing nightly report; Blocked alone is not an owner action."
  },
